== 3.9 Chapter 3 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [The nutrient required by farm animals in the largest quantity is],
  [water],
  [fat],
  [carbohydrate],
  [protein]
)

#mcq(2, [Carbohydrate in a ration is needed mainly for],
  [vision],
  [blood clotting],
  [bone formation],
  [energy]
)

#mcq(3, [Protein is needed in a ration mainly for],
  [teeth],
  [water absorption],
  [energy only],
  [growth and repair of tissue]
)

#mcq(4, [A feed with more than 18 per cent crude fibre is classified as a],
  [supplement],
  [additive],
  [roughage],
  [concentrate]
)

#mcq(5, [Which of these is a roughage?],
  [Maize stover],
  [Groundnut cake],
  [Maize grain],
  [Fish meal]
)

#mcq(6, [Which of these is an energy concentrate?],
  [Soya bean meal],
  [Maize],
  [Fish meal],
  [Groundnut cake]
)

#mcq(7, [Which of these is a protein concentrate?],
  [Groundnut cake],
  [Rice bran],
  [Maize],
  [Cassava chips]
)

#mcq(8, [A supplement is added to a ration to],
  [add fibre],
  [correct a specific deficiency],
  [increase the bulk],
  [add water]
)

#mcq(9, [An additive differs from a supplement because an additive],
  [adds energy],
  [is not a nutrient],
  [adds fibre],
  [adds protein]
)

#mcq(10, [The Pearson square is used to],
  [measure water intake],
  [count the herd],
  [balance two feeds to a target nutrient percentage],
  [estimate the gestation]
)

